{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1211417001:1":{"text":"신밧드, 뭘 들고 있는 거예요?","source_cn":"辛巴达，你手上拿着什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE991A425D499922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211417002:1":{"text":"아무것도 없는 백지야.","source_cn":"一张什么都没写的白纸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB7F8303F5FB59D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::0":{"text":"빈 종이","source_cn":"空白的纸","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52406B157CD0D2C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211417003:1":{"text":"이게... 무슨 쓸모가 있을까요?","source_cn":"这……有用吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30DCDF2CE0BA1463","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211417004:1":{"text":"당연히 없겠지. 근데 이것 말고도 찾은 게 있어!","source_cn":"当然没用。但是除此之外，我还找到了这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCDDD3BA438972C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::0":{"text":"드래곤플레임 콜롬","source_cn":"龙息柱","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945D34543A100365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211417005:1":{"text":"이건 드래곤플레임 콜롬이라고 해. 전쟁 시기에 여행자들이 꿈에 그리던 물건이었는데, 지금은 아주 보기 어려워졌지.","source_cn":"这叫龙息柱，在战争时期可是旅人们梦寐以求的物品，现在已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB42489A1E9E6115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211417006:1":{"text":"입구에 대고 살며시 입김을 불면, 언제든 불을 붙일 수 있어. 마법을 쓸 줄 모르는 여행자에게 아주 편리한 물건이야.","source_cn":"只要在圈口轻轻吹气，随时能点燃火焰。对于不会魔法的旅行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x696CBA438A231359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211417007:1":{"text":"지금은 쉽게 구할 수 있는 성냥이 있으니까, 그렇게 쓸모 있는 물건은 아닌 것 같은데요?","source_cn":"如今火柴很普遍了，这东西也没什么用处嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C8B4F4777AB9F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211417008:1":{"text":"그게 어떻게 같아?","source_cn":"那能一样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE6C6307EA3A0CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211417009:0":{"text":"이건 밑부분에 드래곤의 지방이 저장되어 있다고 해. 드래곤의 화염은 어떤 곳에서든 타오를 수 있고, 심지어 바다 위에서도 말이야.","source_cn":"据说这东西底部储存着龙的油脂。龙焰能在任何地方燃烧，甚...","status":